----- stdout -----
Manage migrations for a Cot project

Usage: cot migration <COMMAND>

Commands:
  make      Generate migrations for a Cot project
  new       Create a new empty migration
  graph     Export the migration dependency graph for visualization
  list      List all migrations of the project, in the order they are applied
  rollback  Rollback migrations up to the specified migration file
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

